{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 354, "text": "؟ﺍﺫﺎﻤﻟ ﻦﻜﻟﻭ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 355, "text": "...ﺔﻳﺎﻐﻠﻟ ﺊﻓﺍﺩ ﺎﻨﻫ ﻮﺠﻟﺍ"}
