{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 359, "text": ".ﻢﻬﻔﻟﺍ ﺕﺄﻄﺧﺃ ﺪﻘﻟ ،ﻻ"}
