{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 365, "text": ".ﺮﻴﻀﺤﺘﻠﻟ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 367, "text": ".ﻚﻟﺬﺑ ﺮﻜﻓﺃ ﻢﻟ .ﺔﻔﺳﺁ ...ﻩﺁ"}
