{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 395, "text": "؟ﻂﻐﻀﻟﺍ ﺐﻨﺠﺘﻟ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 397, "text": ".ﺎﻬﺣﻼﺻﺇ ﻢﺘﻳ ﻢﻟ ﻲﺘﻟﺍ ﺀﺎﻄﺧﻷﺍ ﺾﻌﺑ ﻙﺎﻨﻫ ﻝﺍﺰﻳ ﻻ !ﻢﻌﻧ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 398, "text": ".ﺎﻬﻨﻣ ﺎًﻳﺃ ﻑﺩﺎﺼﺗ ﻻﺃ ﻂﻘﻓ ﻞﻣﺄﻧ"}
